  "description": "Winnovative Excel to PDF Library for .NET (Classic) can be used in .NET Framework, .NET Core and .NET Standard applications on Windows to convert Excel (.xls and .xlsx) documents to PDF.\n\nFor Windows, Linux and macOS, on x64 and ARM64, Winnovative PDF Next converts Excel XLSX documents to PDF with the multi-platform package Winnovative.Pdf.Next.ExcelToPdf and the platform packages Winnovative.Pdf.Next.ExcelToPdf.Windows, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.ExcelToPdf.Windows.Arm64, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.ExcelToPdf.Linux, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.ExcelToPdf.Linux.Arm64 and Winnovative.Pdf.Next.ExcelToPdf.MacOS.\n\nThe full Winnovative PDF Next library, which also converts HTML, Word, RTF and Markdown to PDF, comes in the Winnovative.Pdf.Next, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Windows, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Windows.Arm64, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Linux, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Linux.Arm64 and Winnovative.Pdf.Next.MacOS packages.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* .NET Framework 4.0 and above\n* .NET 10, 9, 8, 7, 6 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows platforms\n* Azure Cloud Services and Azure Virtual Machines\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Convert Excel XLS and XLSX documents to PDF\n* Does not require Microsoft Excel or other third party tools\n* Convert to a memory buffer, file, stream or PDF object\n* Convert all worksheets or only selected worksheets\n* Set the PDF page size to a standard or custom size\n* Set PDF page orientation and document margins\n* Add headers and footers with page numbering to the PDF pages\n* Append or prepend external PDF files to the result\n* Password-protect and digitally sign PDF documents\n* Add graphic elements to the PDF pages\n* Generate PDF/A and PDF/X compliant documents\n* Generate CMYK and grayscale PDF documents\n* Edit, merge and split PDF documents",
